      "description": "Dawcade FX is the effects rack of Dawcade, as its own app.\n\n• 37 effects: dynamics, EQ and tone, delay and reverb, modulation, drive, pitch and voice, performance, spectral and utility.\n• Chain as many as you like. Drag to reorder, bypass any slot, blend dry and wet with the MIX knob.\n• More than 120 ready-made chains from Dawcade for vocals, drums, keys, guitar and mastering.\n• Microphone, audio interface or audio file input. Record the output as a 24-bit WAV and share it.\n• Factory presets, A/B compare and your own chain presets.\n• Choose the sample rate and buffer size; an optional output limiter keeps long chains from clipping.\n• Every effect is also an AUv3 plug-in for other DAWs and music apps.\n• Same screens as in Dawcade: arcade cabinet, cartridges and real hardware-style panels.\n\nNo account, no subscription, no ads. Dawcade FX does not collect any data.\n\nRequires iOS 17 or later.",
